msgstr "Tidak bisa tersambung"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:702
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Tersambung"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:703
msgid "Connecting to {device}"
msgstr "Menyambungkan ke {device}"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:704
msgid "Connecting"
msgstr "Menyambungkan"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:739
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Tutup"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:901
msgid "Close ZenLink?"
msgstr "Tutup ZenLink?"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:904
msgid "ZenLink can keep running in the system tray so your devices stay connected."
msgstr "ZenLink bisa tetap berjalan di system tray agar perangkat tetap terhubung."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:914
msgid "Remember my choice"
msgstr "Ingat pilihan saya"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:933
msgid "You can change this in Settings."
msgstr "Bisa diubah di Pengaturan."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:939
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Batal"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:941
msgid "Quit ZenLink"
msgstr "Keluar dari ZenLink"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:942
msgid "Minimize to tray"
msgstr "Kecilkan ke tray"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:992
msgid "How should ZenLink connect?"
msgstr "ZenLink mau tersambung lewat apa?"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:993
msgid "Nothing connects and no driver changes until you continue."
msgstr "Belum ada yang tersambung dan driver tidak diubah sampai kamu lanjut."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1011
msgid "Standard · full control"
msgstr "Standar · kontrol penuh"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1012
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Disarankan"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1013
msgid "Uses Apple's own driver. Most compatible, stable and easy."
msgstr "Pakai driver bawaan Apple. Paling kompatibel, stabil dan gampang."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1015
msgid "Up to 60 fps, HEVC (device-limited bitrate, about 4–6 Mbps)"
msgstr "Sampai 60 fps, HEVC (bitrate dibatasi perangkat, sekitar 4–6 Mbps)"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1016
msgid "Mouse touch, keyboard, gestures and buttons"
msgstr "Sentuh pakai mouse, keyboard, gestur dan tombol"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1017
msgid "Apple's own driver, nothing to install"
msgstr "Driver Apple sendiri, tidak perlu pasang apa-apa"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1018
msgid "Wired or Wi-Fi (after a one-time setup with the cable)"
msgstr "Kabel atau Wi-Fi (setelah setup sekali pakai kabel)"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1019
msgid "iOS 17–26: Hybrid Control (experimental)"
msgstr "iOS 17–26: Hybrid Control (eksperimental)"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1020
msgid "iOS 16 or older: use ZenLink Studio"
msgstr "iOS 16 ke bawah: pakai ZenLink Studio"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1029
msgid "For live streaming"
msgstr "Untuk live streaming"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1030
msgid "Best quality for streaming: high bitrate (measured 12–30 Mbps), up to 60 fps, very low latency. Needs the libusb0 driver."
msgstr "Kualitas terbaik untuk streaming: bitrate tinggi (terukur 12–30 Mbps), sampai 60 fps, latensi sangat rendah. Butuh driver libusb0."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1032
msgid "Up to 60 fps, full native resolution over the cable, high-bitrate H.264"
msgstr "Sampai 60 fps, resolusi native penuh lewat kabel, H.264 bitrate tinggi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1033
msgid "Wired (USB) or Wi-Fi (AirPlay, no driver)"
msgstr "Kabel (USB) atau Wi-Fi (AirPlay, tanpa driver)"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1034
msgid "Picture and sound only: no touch, keyboard or gestures"
msgstr "Gambar dan suara saja: tanpa sentuh, keyboard, gestur"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1035
msgid "Apple apps can't see the device until you switch back"
msgstr "Aplikasi Apple tidak melihat perangkat sampai balik ke Apple Driver"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1042
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Sambungan"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1046
msgid "Wired"
msgstr "Kabel"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1057
msgid "You can change it any time in Settings › Connection & driver. Changing it may need an app restart and reconnecting the cable."
msgstr "Bisa diganti kapan saja di Pengaturan › Koneksi & driver. Ganti mode bisa perlu restart app dan colok ulang kabel."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1064
msgid "Change device type"
msgstr "Ganti jenis perangkat"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1071
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Lanjut"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1190
msgid "Detected"
msgstr "Terdeteksi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1191
msgid " detected"
msgstr " terdeteksi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1192
msgid "Mirror and control compatible Apple devices using USB or Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Mirroring dan kontrol perangkat Apple lewat USB atau Wi-Fi."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1193
msgid "Android Smartphone / Tablet"
msgstr "Smartphone / Tablet Android"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1194
msgid "High-performance Android mirroring and control over USB or Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Mirroring dan kontrol Android berperforma tinggi lewat USB atau Wi-Fi."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1196
msgid "Apple Driver or ZenLink Studio"
msgstr "Apple Driver atau ZenLink Studio"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1197
msgid "Wired or Wi-Fi"
msgstr "Kabel atau Wi-Fi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1200
msgid "Through ADB and scrcpy, no app on the phone"
msgstr "Lewat ADB dan scrcpy, tanpa aplikasi di HP"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1201
msgid "Wired or Wi-Fi, any Android brand"
msgstr "Kabel atau Wi-Fi, semua merek Android"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1236
msgid "Welcome to ZenLink"
msgstr "Selamat datang di ZenLink"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1239
msgid "Which device would you like to connect?"
msgstr "Perangkat apa yang ingin kamu sambungkan?"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1308
msgid "Apple and Android devices are both connected. Choose the one to mirror."
msgstr "Perangkat Apple dan Android sama-sama tersambung. Pilih yang ingin dicerminkan."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1315
msgid "Remember device type"
msgstr "Ingat jenis perangkat"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1319
msgid "You can change it any time in Settings › Device type or with the Back button."
msgstr "Bisa diganti kapan saja lewat Pengaturan › Jenis perangkat atau tombol Kembali."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1432
msgid "Android video"
msgstr "Video Android"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1436
msgid "A profile fills in resolution, FPS, bitrate and codec; change one value and the profile becomes Custom. Each phone keeps its own settings (the same over USB and Wi-Fi). Encoders are read from the phone on the first mirroring; if the chosen encoder fails, ZenLink tries another hardware encoder, then H.264, at most 4 times, and keeps your choice."
msgstr "Profile mengisi resolusi, FPS, bitrate dan codec; ubah satu nilai dan profile jadi Custom. Setiap HP menyimpan pengaturannya sendiri (USB dan Wi-Fi sama). Encoder dibaca dari HP saat mirroring pertama; kalau encoder pilihan gagal, ZenLink mencoba encoder hardware lain lalu H.264, paling banyak 4 kali, dan pilihanmu tetap disimpan."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1444
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "Resolusi"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1444
msgid "Longest side."
msgstr "Sisi terpanjang."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1451
msgid "A cap; the phone never goes above its refresh rate."
msgstr "Batas atas; HP tidak melebihi refresh rate layarnya."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1470
msgid "H.265 needs HEVC Video Extensions on Windows."
msgstr "H.265 butuh HEVC Video Extensions di Windows."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1471
msgid "This phone has no H.265 encoder."
msgstr "HP ini tidak punya encoder H.265."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1472
msgid "Auto = H.264, the lowest latency."
msgstr "Auto = H.264, latency paling rendah."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1482
msgid "Detected on the first mirroring."
msgstr "Terdeteksi saat mirroring pertama."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1491
msgid "In use"
msgstr "Sedang dipakai"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1520
msgid "Already on the cable? Press the Wi-Fi button next to the phone's name, done. Without a cable (Android 11+):"
msgstr "Sudah pakai kabel? Tekan tombol Wi-Fi di samping nama HP, selesai. Tanpa kabel (Android 11+):"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1527
msgid "Option 1 · Scan a QR code (easiest)"
msgstr "Cara 1 · Pindai QR (paling mudah)"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1528
msgid "The phone and the PC are on the same Wi-Fi."
msgstr "HP dan PC tersambung ke Wi-Fi yang sama."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1529
msgid "On the phone: Settings › Developer options › Wireless debugging › turn it on."
msgstr "Di HP: Pengaturan › Opsi pengembang › Debugging nirkabel (Wireless debugging) › aktifkan."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1530
msgid "Press the button below, then on the phone tap \"Pair device with QR code\" and scan."
msgstr "Tekan tombol di bawah, lalu di HP ketuk \"Sambungkan perangkat dengan kode QR\" dan pindai."

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1536
msgid "Show QR code"
msgstr "Tampilkan QR"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1538
msgid "Show a QR code to scan on the phone"
msgstr "Tampilkan QR untuk dipindai di HP"

#: apps/desktop/ui/app.slint:1562
msgid "On the phone: Wireless debugging › \"Pair device with QR code\", then scan this code."
