msgid "Another app is using the device's screen (Xcode, QuickTime, TikTok LIVE Studio). Close it and try again."
msgstr "Aplikasi lain sedang memakai layar perangkat (Xcode, QuickTime, TikTok LIVE Studio). Tutup dulu, lalu coba lagi."

