msgstr "Driver ZenLink Studio sudah terpasang, tapi Windows belum memakainya untuk perangkat ini. Cabut lalu colok lagi kabelnya (restart Windows kalau belum berhasil)."

#. added by hand
msgid "The USB Direct driver isn't installed for this device yet. Open Settings > Connection & Drivers and press Install USB Direct driver, then reconnect the cable."
msgstr "Driver ZenLink Studio belum terpasang di perangkat ini. Buka Pengaturan > Koneksi & driver, tekan Pasang driver ZenLink Studio, lalu colok ulang kabelnya."

#. added by hand
msgid "Another driver change is running."
msgstr "Penggantian driver lain sedang berjalan."

